WEBVTT

00:41.968 --> 00:45.963
MY ROYAL NEMESIS

00:48.966 --> 00:49.841
Hello?

00:49.925 --> 00:51.426
Where's Shin Seo-ri? Is she with you?

00:51.510 --> 00:53.220
Wait, didn't she go to see you?

00:53.303 --> 00:55.180
They said she left
after her boyfriend called.

00:55.264 --> 00:57.015
-Who said that?
-It wasn't a crew member.

00:57.099 --> 00:58.934
I think it was an extra.

01:00.143 --> 01:01.478
Damn it.

01:05.899 --> 01:06.984
Shin Seo-ri.

01:09.528 --> 01:11.029
Shin Seo-ri, wake up.

01:11.530 --> 01:12.864
Shin Seo-ri.

01:13.365 --> 01:14.366
Shin Seo-ri!

01:25.252 --> 01:26.336
You're okay.

01:27.671 --> 01:28.880
You're okay.

01:31.883 --> 01:33.093
Shin Seo-ri, look at me.

01:34.052 --> 01:35.554
I'm right here.

01:37.556 --> 01:38.682
Who do you think you are?

01:39.641 --> 01:41.101
Who are you to…

01:48.066 --> 01:49.693
What am I supposed to do?

01:52.237 --> 01:54.489
What do you want from me?

02:17.546 --> 02:21.835
EPISODE 12
RECLAIMING LOST TIME

02:21.975 --> 02:23.393
She's on her way home?

02:23.477 --> 02:24.811
I mean…

02:24.895 --> 02:25.979
Hello?

02:27.189 --> 02:28.523
You couldn't tell me any sooner?

02:28.607 --> 02:30.692
Got me running around in circles.

02:37.324 --> 02:39.785
GONG TAE-WOO AND HAN MIN-HUI EXPECTING

02:39.868 --> 02:41.161
Damn it.

02:42.412 --> 02:44.790
Gong Tae-woo, that bastard.

02:44.873 --> 02:45.999
So much for "anti-marriage."

02:46.083 --> 02:49.252
It hasn't even been two months
since we broke up.

02:49.336 --> 02:50.754
And you got her pregnant?

03:04.601 --> 03:05.811
Ji-hyo.

03:05.894 --> 03:06.812
What?

03:06.895 --> 03:10.107
You have a morning shoot tomorrow.
You shouldn't be doing all this right now.

03:10.190 --> 03:12.984
Baek Gwang-nam?
Shouldn't you be following Shin Seo-ri?

03:13.068 --> 03:15.112
How did you end up here?

03:15.195 --> 03:16.571
Did you put a GPS on me?

03:18.031 --> 03:19.991
You're a celebrity, so act like one.

03:20.075 --> 03:21.410
Have some composure.

03:21.493 --> 03:23.161
Maintain some basic etiquette.

03:23.245 --> 03:25.122
Etiquette, my ass.

03:25.622 --> 03:27.040
Why don't you show some?

03:27.124 --> 03:30.460
I mean, if you're a manager,
you should act like one.

03:30.544 --> 03:32.337
You always talk back.

03:32.421 --> 03:34.506
What, are you…

03:34.589 --> 03:35.882
rich or something?

03:36.466 --> 03:38.051
What are you talking about? Jeez.

03:38.844 --> 03:40.262
Why did you take your socks off?

03:40.345 --> 03:42.180
Gong Tae-woo, I hope you go bald.

03:42.264 --> 03:43.473
Shiny bald head.

03:43.557 --> 03:46.476
Ji-hyo, please get up. Come on.

03:46.560 --> 03:47.519
Let go.

03:47.602 --> 03:49.271
Go sleep at home. Get up. Please.

03:49.354 --> 03:51.398
I live here.

03:51.481 --> 03:52.441
Let me take you home.

03:52.524 --> 03:54.234
I told you I'm buying today.

03:54.735 --> 03:55.902
-Who are you?
-Jeez.

03:55.986 --> 03:57.446
-Hold on.
-Wrong room, I guess.

04:01.116 --> 04:02.242
-Wait.
-What are you doing?

04:02.325 --> 04:05.120
-Wasn't that Yoon Ji-hyo just now?
-Get off. That hurts!

04:05.203 --> 04:07.038
What would Yoon Ji-hyo be doing here?

04:07.122 --> 04:09.458
Who are you? Please leave. Get out.

04:09.541 --> 04:10.542
He said it's not her.

04:10.625 --> 04:12.002
You must've seen wrong.

04:12.085 --> 04:13.253
-It was her.
-Get out.

04:13.336 --> 04:15.330
-Why would Yoon Ji-hyo be here?
-Hey, let go!

04:15.422 --> 04:17.591
-No, babe. It's not her.
-Get off me!

04:40.989 --> 04:42.365
Wake up, Shin Seo-ri.

04:42.991 --> 04:44.075
We're here.

04:45.118 --> 04:46.244
Already?

04:49.664 --> 04:50.665
This is not my house.

04:50.749 --> 04:52.042
Yeah, it's my house.

04:54.127 --> 04:56.671
You're not going anywhere alone today.
Resistance is futile.

05:12.896 --> 05:15.065
It is practically the size of a field.

05:16.858 --> 05:19.945
It would take three days and nights
just to roll across from here to there.

05:20.487 --> 05:21.863
Don't exaggerate.

05:26.201 --> 05:29.079
Namsan Tower looks so huge.

05:29.162 --> 05:31.248
Cha Se-gye,
you have really made it in the world.

05:31.331 --> 05:32.791
It was not all bluff.

05:34.918 --> 05:36.711
But you are destitute now.

05:38.171 --> 05:39.589
Then will this house be seized soon?

05:39.673 --> 05:41.299
Seized? No way.

05:41.383 --> 05:43.260
Who cares if you have
that view of Namsan Tower?

05:43.343 --> 05:44.926
When only a rocky road awaits you.

05:45.026 --> 05:46.471
Who knows when this will be seized?

05:46.555 --> 05:48.557
Might as well take it all in
while I still can.

05:50.642 --> 05:53.478
You're treating me
like I'm some dirt-poor pauper.

05:54.521 --> 05:55.438
So pretty.

05:55.522 --> 05:57.315
Look at it sparkle.

06:00.360 --> 06:02.279
I didn't mean for the invite
to be so slapdash.

06:02.362 --> 06:03.280
But just so you know,

06:03.363 --> 06:05.282
you're the first woman I've brought home.

06:05.365 --> 06:07.909
Think of this as your own home
and make yourself comfortable--

06:07.993 --> 06:09.786
I am already comfortable.
Why would I not be?

06:09.870 --> 06:11.079
Oh, you're already comfortable.

06:11.162 --> 06:12.455
Quick to adapt, as expected.

06:12.539 --> 06:15.250
Right, I am going to lie down
and relax for a bit.

06:21.548 --> 06:23.633
Maybe that's a bit too relaxed?

06:26.761 --> 06:28.388
It's just the two of us here.

06:38.440 --> 06:39.441
Hey.

06:40.650 --> 06:41.651
Well…

06:42.944 --> 06:44.112
Go lie down in the bedroom.

06:46.323 --> 06:48.658
The bed there is plusher
and more comfortable.

06:48.742 --> 06:49.826
Cha Se-gye.

06:51.036 --> 06:53.079
I may have followed you in
because I did not have

06:53.163 --> 06:54.456
the energy to argue with you,

06:54.539 --> 06:56.958
but my heart has yet to give you
consent to go that far.

06:58.460 --> 06:59.628
I see.

07:02.631 --> 07:05.508
Turns out the struggle continues.

07:18.980 --> 07:20.398
Help me!

07:20.899 --> 07:21.983
Help…

07:24.819 --> 07:26.363
What was that?

07:26.446 --> 07:28.406
A childhood memory
from the master of this body?

07:28.490 --> 07:31.534
When your vital energy returns,
it will guide Your Highness's soul.

07:32.035 --> 07:35.747
Is this body already preparing itself
to welcome back its master?

07:35.830 --> 07:38.375
Could that be why dormant memories stir?

07:39.960 --> 07:41.044
What?

07:42.963 --> 07:44.130
Mommy!

07:45.173 --> 07:47.676
-Consent or not, I don't care.
-Hey, Cha Se-gye!

07:49.010 --> 07:50.345
Cha Se-gye.

07:51.304 --> 07:52.639
Cha Se-gye!

07:53.139 --> 07:55.141
I'm doing this day in and day out,

07:55.225 --> 07:56.768
and I can't even make minimum wage.

07:56.851 --> 08:00.146
When, oh when, will I ever

08:00.230 --> 08:03.858
Escape these streets

08:03.942 --> 08:08.154
I'm not asking for a luxury high-rise

08:08.238 --> 08:12.409
Just spare me the monthly room rental life

08:23.378 --> 08:24.796
What is your name?

08:24.879 --> 08:26.506
My name is Dan-sim.

08:26.589 --> 08:27.716
Kang Dan-sim.

08:31.636 --> 08:32.929
Oh my.

08:33.013 --> 08:34.180
Goodness.

08:34.264 --> 08:35.557
What's this now?

08:35.640 --> 08:37.058
Seriously?

08:37.142 --> 08:39.019
Even my hwagyeong has been awakened now?

08:39.519 --> 08:40.937
Jeez.

08:53.908 --> 08:55.201
Stop staring.

08:55.285 --> 08:57.120
A demon has entered your eyes.

08:57.203 --> 08:58.455
Go away, demon.

08:58.538 --> 08:59.664
Shoo.

09:00.832 --> 09:03.251
Talking nonsense again.
You must be feeling better.

09:04.335 --> 09:06.463
Don't worry tonight and get some sleep.

09:07.797 --> 09:09.549
I'll take care of everything tomorrow.

09:10.967 --> 09:12.302
You always say that.

09:12.385 --> 09:14.763
Try finding a man in Korea
more capable than me.

09:14.846 --> 09:17.015
This isn't me talking big. This is a fact.

09:17.098 --> 09:19.142
If you are so capable,
how did you end up destitute?

09:20.935 --> 09:22.103
I'll turn that around too.

09:22.937 --> 09:25.982
I totally blindsided Choi Mun-do today.

09:26.483 --> 09:28.526
You should've seen the look on his face.

09:30.278 --> 09:32.197
No, scrap that. You'll ruin your eyes.

09:39.704 --> 09:41.414
You know, I've been feeling good recently.

09:43.291 --> 09:44.709
Everything hit the fan…

09:47.253 --> 09:48.463
but strangely, I feel good.

09:50.256 --> 09:52.050
Maybe it's because you're by my side?

09:54.302 --> 09:55.553
In hindsight…

09:57.555 --> 09:59.349
I think I needed something to hold on to.

09:59.891 --> 10:01.101
Money, honor,

10:01.684 --> 10:02.560
status.

10:03.686 --> 10:04.687
Things like that.

10:04.771 --> 10:07.315
I had to hold on to something
to feel like I was alive.

10:07.398 --> 10:09.776
Running like a car without brakes,

10:09.859 --> 10:12.153
it felt like I was speeding
through the void.

10:12.237 --> 10:15.490
But after aimlessly drifting,
going nowhere,

10:15.573 --> 10:17.951
and crashing hard, I finally get it.

10:18.451 --> 10:19.661
What's really important.

10:21.371 --> 10:23.957
What I truly need.

10:25.834 --> 10:26.918
I just…

10:30.672 --> 10:32.340
I just need you.

10:37.804 --> 10:40.306
Still, having nothing at all just isn't
a good look for a man.

10:40.974 --> 10:42.142
Just wait a little bit.

10:42.809 --> 10:45.478
Watch me make it back to the top.

10:47.689 --> 10:49.315
Get your hopes up, Shin Seo-ri.

10:59.409 --> 11:00.702
How is the Chairman doing?

11:00.785 --> 11:02.662
He's the same. Still unconscious.

11:02.745 --> 11:04.038
No major changes in vital signs.

11:04.122 --> 11:06.124
I'll contact you immediately
if anything changes.

11:08.418 --> 11:11.171
Actually, you should come right now.

11:11.254 --> 11:12.338
Doctor!

11:12.881 --> 11:14.132
Doctor!

11:18.678 --> 11:19.554
I see.

11:19.637 --> 11:20.805
PRODIGAL SON RETURNS TO CHAIL

11:23.516 --> 11:26.186
If the witness isn't cooperating,

11:26.269 --> 11:29.230
it might be better to issue
an official summons first.

11:29.314 --> 11:32.233
Buy us some time to replace
the head of the resort TF team.

11:32.317 --> 11:35.195
I understand. I'll have it issued
and summon him this week.

11:35.278 --> 11:36.487
All right.

11:49.709 --> 11:52.212
I'm told the Chairman has just woken up.

11:58.635 --> 12:00.136
Seo-ri.

12:00.220 --> 12:02.055
My sweet girl.

12:46.599 --> 12:48.059
Cha Se-gye?

12:48.142 --> 12:49.477
Where are you?

12:51.271 --> 12:52.272
Did you leave?

13:18.006 --> 13:19.674
MY AMAZING FAN

13:21.342 --> 13:22.302
You're awake?

13:24.554 --> 13:25.722
Let's make breakfast.

13:39.944 --> 13:41.779
When did you put this on me?

13:42.572 --> 13:43.614
Who gave you permission?

13:44.282 --> 13:46.534
Well? Do you like it?

13:47.327 --> 13:48.745
Is this some sort of leash?

13:48.828 --> 13:50.538
Hey, who calls that a leash?

13:50.621 --> 13:51.539
Just give it back then.

13:51.622 --> 13:53.291
Who said I did not like it?

13:56.169 --> 13:58.087
Why are you making such a fuss
about breakfast?

13:59.130 --> 14:00.173
I'm a good cook.

14:02.759 --> 14:05.428
My nickname when I studied abroad
was Jang-geum.

14:05.511 --> 14:06.763
Cha Jang-geum.

14:10.099 --> 14:13.144
You said you were Jang-geum,
but I do not see it at all.

14:14.437 --> 14:17.732
For breakfast, you need some hot soup
to warm your stomach.

14:17.815 --> 14:19.650
What is this? It is all dried up.

14:29.994 --> 14:32.038
I knew you'd say that,
so I prepared something else.

14:32.121 --> 14:33.706
How's that for a plot twist?

14:33.790 --> 14:36.751
That's soup from the best restaurant
within the Four Gates.

14:39.295 --> 14:40.463
Ridiculous.

14:45.635 --> 14:46.844
Pretty.

14:48.971 --> 14:50.014
It looks good on you.

14:50.723 --> 14:53.893
I bought this and kept waiting
for the right time to give it to you.

14:53.976 --> 14:55.770
Today's timing was perfect.

14:58.773 --> 15:00.274
When did you even buy this?

15:00.358 --> 15:01.776
Now I feel bad.

15:02.527 --> 15:05.196
I have not really done anything for you.

15:06.322 --> 15:08.574
Seriously? Are you looking down
on my token?

15:08.658 --> 15:10.660
Things have been
pretty tough for me lately.

15:10.743 --> 15:12.453
Little things like that give me comfort.

15:14.455 --> 15:16.749
I've been taking
that herbal tonic regularly too.

15:20.044 --> 15:23.214
Thanks to you, I'm getting both
mental and physical care.

15:23.297 --> 15:24.340
Come on.

15:29.512 --> 15:31.180
If you really feel that bad about it,

15:31.722 --> 15:33.516
I'll give you a chance to make up for it.

15:35.017 --> 15:36.561
I'll look forward to our 100th day.

15:37.186 --> 15:38.438
What?

15:43.609 --> 15:44.485
What?

15:46.320 --> 15:47.864
Were you not planning to celebrate it?

15:51.284 --> 15:53.035
That's hurtful.

15:56.080 --> 15:57.582
So, what should we do for our 100th?

15:58.124 --> 15:59.542
That was just a joke.

16:00.042 --> 16:01.627
Just let me know.
I'll prepare everything.

16:03.880 --> 16:04.964
Our 100th day?

16:05.882 --> 16:07.091
Well, you know…

16:08.134 --> 16:09.969
That sort of stuff

16:10.052 --> 16:11.512
used to make me cringe too.

16:11.596 --> 16:13.973
But I thought I'd try it out with you.

16:18.186 --> 16:19.270
What?

16:21.522 --> 16:22.690
Too cheesy?

16:23.566 --> 16:25.485
Is it too childish
if we're not in middle school?

16:27.528 --> 16:28.654
But I…

16:29.906 --> 16:31.574
want to try all of it with you.

16:37.914 --> 16:39.207
Such a fool.

16:54.680 --> 16:56.182
I do not want to lose you.

16:56.265 --> 16:57.850
I want to keep seeing you.

16:58.434 --> 17:00.603
Could you keep smiling like that

17:01.395 --> 17:03.147
even if you knew I would disappear?

17:16.035 --> 17:17.245
CHIEF OF STAFF SON JAE-HAN

17:19.747 --> 17:20.915
Give me a second.

17:33.803 --> 17:34.929
-When?
-Yes.

17:35.012 --> 17:37.265
He woke up at dawn yesterday
and fell back asleep.

17:37.348 --> 17:39.433
He's undergoing
a thorough examination right now.

17:41.185 --> 17:43.437
But why is the hospital
only telling us now?

17:44.063 --> 17:45.731
All right. Have the car ready immediately.

17:47.567 --> 17:50.736
Even today, the ill-omened star
hangs in the Seoul sky.

17:50.820 --> 17:53.906
It appears this red comet,
which had been adorning the Seoul sky

17:53.990 --> 17:56.826
for over three months,
is about to set off on a long journey.

17:56.909 --> 17:59.495
In about 15 days,
it will leave Earth's orbit

17:59.579 --> 18:02.498
and vanish once more
into the unknown darkness

18:02.582 --> 18:04.250
of the far side of the universe.

18:04.333 --> 18:06.836
Vanish into the darkness…

18:07.503 --> 18:10.172
It's a relief
that the Chairman woke up, isn't it?

18:10.673 --> 18:12.174
Yes, it is a relief.

18:12.258 --> 18:14.802
Still, it's comforting to know
that he has you by his side

18:14.888 --> 18:15.889
at a time like this.

18:15.989 --> 18:18.180
He has changed a lot, thanks to you.

18:19.682 --> 18:20.933
He almost seems human now.

18:21.017 --> 18:24.395
He may come across as prickly,
but inside he's really not like that.

18:24.478 --> 18:26.606
He may look thick-skinned
after all that criticism,

18:26.689 --> 18:28.566
but no one ever truly grows numb to that.

18:28.649 --> 18:29.942
He's probably just pretending.

18:30.026 --> 18:31.068
Right.

18:32.820 --> 18:34.113
Never truly numb.

18:38.117 --> 18:39.035
Father!

18:39.118 --> 18:40.453
Father!

18:40.536 --> 18:42.246
-Father!
-I thought you were dying.

18:42.330 --> 18:43.372
Do you even know

18:43.456 --> 18:44.957
-how devastated I was?
-Father.

18:45.583 --> 18:47.335
That hurts, you brat!

18:47.418 --> 18:50.296
Good grief. Did you forget
you're built like a mountain?

18:51.172 --> 18:53.424
Our father is back.
That's our father all right.

18:53.507 --> 18:54.717
Just look at that fiery temper.

18:54.800 --> 18:56.719
All his mental faculties
are as sharp as ever.

18:57.303 --> 18:58.929
All the test results came back clear.

18:59.555 --> 19:00.931
Thank goodness for that.

19:01.015 --> 19:03.809
Everyone was so worried
because you wouldn't wake up.

19:03.893 --> 19:05.186
Hey, Choi Mun-do.

19:05.269 --> 19:08.939
Look at you slapping on
your second face for Father.

19:09.023 --> 19:11.609
Father, don't believe a word
this punk Choi Mun-do says.

19:11.692 --> 19:13.694
If you only knew
the wicked things he did

19:13.778 --> 19:17.031
while you were lying in that bed…

19:17.114 --> 19:19.450
Are you talking
about his interim CEO appointment?

19:19.533 --> 19:21.077
You're already all caught up.

19:22.244 --> 19:24.246
You're finished now.

19:24.330 --> 19:27.875
Mun-do went behind our backs
and got every single executive

19:27.958 --> 19:29.460
in his pocket.

19:29.543 --> 19:31.837
How else could he have gotten that
railroaded through

19:31.921 --> 19:33.839
with a majority that fast?

19:33.923 --> 19:36.133
Now that Father is up and about,

19:36.217 --> 19:39.303
you better not argue and step down
from the CEO position immediately.

19:39.387 --> 19:40.763
Don't let things get ugly.

19:40.846 --> 19:43.474
Why would he? If anything,
it should get ugly for you two.

19:43.557 --> 19:45.518
If you two hadn't made
such a mess of things,

19:45.601 --> 19:48.437
maybe the board wouldn't have
skipped over my own children

19:48.521 --> 19:51.107
to appoint Mun-do as the interim CEO.

19:51.190 --> 19:53.526
You remain clueless
about your own shortcomings,

19:53.609 --> 19:54.860
yet you corner Mun-do!

19:54.944 --> 19:56.278
Father!

19:56.362 --> 19:58.656
You need to listen to me.
You can't trust this punk.

19:58.739 --> 20:00.324
This whole situation right now

20:00.408 --> 20:02.868
was orchestrated by Choi Mun-do.

20:02.952 --> 20:04.161
That's enough!

20:04.245 --> 20:06.455
I can't believe I must claim

20:06.539 --> 20:09.417
you two imbeciles as my children.

20:10.000 --> 20:11.252
My goodness.

20:14.088 --> 20:15.631
Grandfather.

20:15.715 --> 20:17.633
Se-gye, you're here.

20:18.134 --> 20:21.053
Se-gye, you should say
something to Grandfather too.

20:21.137 --> 20:22.680
Yeah, Se-gye.

20:22.763 --> 20:25.933
This is your chance to tell him in detail
about all the atrocious things

20:26.016 --> 20:27.184
that punk has done--

20:27.268 --> 20:29.645
When it comes to atrocities,
he's the worst offender.

20:29.729 --> 20:31.397
What? Carcinogens?

20:31.480 --> 20:34.024
Were you so blinded by money
that you sold your conscience?

20:34.108 --> 20:36.569
Even when they all called you
a money-grubber,

20:36.652 --> 20:37.653
I just let it go.

20:37.737 --> 20:40.614
After acting like you're better
than everybody else and walking out,

20:40.698 --> 20:43.284
this is the best you could do?
This seedy little scheme?

20:43.367 --> 20:47.121
Without Mun-do's investment,
you'd have fallen flat on your face, punk!

20:47.621 --> 20:51.041
None of you are qualified
to be CEO or President.

20:51.584 --> 20:53.210
Get out of my sight, the whole lot of you.

21:06.348 --> 21:08.768
Still, I thought blood would run
thicker than water.

21:08.851 --> 21:11.228
Who knew he relied
on Mun-do that much?

21:12.146 --> 21:13.189
Se-gye,

21:13.272 --> 21:15.065
why didn't you speak up in there?

21:15.149 --> 21:16.734
You should've said something.

21:16.817 --> 21:18.861
I guess he has a conscience.

21:18.944 --> 21:21.363
Se-gye, you should know
we were unjustly dragged down

21:21.447 --> 21:22.823
by your sinking ship.

21:22.907 --> 21:24.950
Is Grandfather really okay?

21:28.162 --> 21:29.747
Sensory reactions are normal again,

21:29.830 --> 21:31.582
and the swelling
in the brain has gone down.

21:31.665 --> 21:32.625
What about

21:33.167 --> 21:35.294
the aftereffects you mentioned?

21:35.377 --> 21:39.131
There's a temporary memory gap
of about two weeks before the accident.

21:39.215 --> 21:41.842
But he's recovering well,
so let's keep an eye on it.

21:41.926 --> 21:42.802
Okay.

21:42.885 --> 21:44.470
-Thank you.
-Sure.

21:51.185 --> 21:52.311
Mun-do,

21:52.394 --> 21:54.230
you've been through a lot.

21:54.939 --> 21:57.733
Thanks to you, the company survived.

21:59.151 --> 22:00.402
Not at all, Uncle.

22:01.737 --> 22:03.864
You should also make peace
with the rest of the family.

22:04.406 --> 22:06.325
And give Se-gye a chance
to make things right.

22:06.408 --> 22:08.869
He must have developed
business acumen through his startup.

22:08.953 --> 22:11.330
I'm sure he'll really prove
himself this time.

22:12.414 --> 22:13.791
Yes, sure.

22:16.043 --> 22:18.170
You're absolutely right.

22:24.385 --> 22:25.636
Interim guardian?

22:25.719 --> 22:26.637
Yes.

22:26.720 --> 22:29.515
Your cousin wanted us to contact
the family after daybreak.

22:29.598 --> 22:31.934
And he requested that family visits

22:32.017 --> 22:33.477
be restricted for the time being.

22:33.561 --> 22:35.271
-Unbelievable.
-Though mild,

22:35.354 --> 22:37.106
he is still suffering from aftereffects.

22:37.189 --> 22:39.066
Absolute rest
is the top priority right now,

22:39.149 --> 22:41.443
and as his attending physician,
I am of the same opinion.

22:48.200 --> 22:49.451
How diligent you are,

22:49.535 --> 22:50.828
Choi Mun-do.

22:55.833 --> 22:56.750
FORTUNE TELLING

22:56.834 --> 22:58.919
Why do you look so miserable?

22:59.003 --> 23:01.380
Your Highness, you see…

23:02.798 --> 23:04.550
Your hwagyeong has been awakened? Now?

23:04.633 --> 23:06.468
I know I may look spiritually powerful,

23:06.552 --> 23:08.721
like I could perform a mighty sword dance,

23:08.804 --> 23:10.222
but the truth is,

23:10.306 --> 23:12.182
I'm a sham shaman.

23:12.266 --> 23:14.602
No matter how much I trained
since I was young,

23:14.685 --> 23:16.145
my spiritual eye wouldn't open.

23:16.228 --> 23:17.396
The only thing

23:18.105 --> 23:20.065
that got sharper was my tongue.

23:20.149 --> 23:22.484
I never in a million years imagined

23:22.568 --> 23:24.570
that would suddenly awaken at this age.

23:25.905 --> 23:28.699
For one, you do not look
that spiritually powerful.

23:29.575 --> 23:30.743
Right.

23:31.327 --> 23:32.703
But if you are this faint-hearted…

23:33.329 --> 23:35.789
Your hwagyeong has been awakened,
and you have found your voice.

23:35.873 --> 23:37.291
You will soon be channeling spirits.

23:40.294 --> 23:41.712
Well, for now,

23:41.795 --> 23:43.589
I can only see Your Highness.

23:43.672 --> 23:46.133
It's tolerable for the time being.

23:46.634 --> 23:47.551
You can see me?

23:47.635 --> 23:48.844
Yes.

23:48.928 --> 23:51.680
You were back in Joseon.

23:51.764 --> 23:54.975
You said your name was Kang Dan-sim.

23:58.145 --> 23:59.521
Kang Dan-sim.

24:02.191 --> 24:04.568
I came clutching at straws.

24:06.528 --> 24:07.488
But I am to leave?

24:08.614 --> 24:10.908
So I must have seen
her childhood for a reason.

24:11.617 --> 24:12.743
Her childhood?

24:12.826 --> 24:15.079
I believe it is a childhood memory
of this body's master.

24:16.538 --> 24:19.208
Tangled memories.
Phantom voices out of the blue.

24:19.291 --> 24:20.584
That must mean…

24:22.461 --> 24:24.380
the body's master is on her way back?

24:24.463 --> 24:28.342
That would make sense
if her soul were still alive in Joseon.

24:28.425 --> 24:30.344
But there's no way of knowing.

24:30.427 --> 24:32.805
Who knows if her soul is alive or dead?

24:32.888 --> 24:33.806
She is alive.

24:33.889 --> 24:36.892
My body remains in a deathly trance
back in Joseon.

24:36.976 --> 24:37.893
I see.

24:37.977 --> 24:39.144
That body would not be alive

24:40.062 --> 24:42.189
if it had no soul inside it.

24:51.824 --> 24:53.367
Yes, sure.

24:53.450 --> 24:54.994
You're absolutely right.

25:01.625 --> 25:02.793
Are you insane?

25:02.876 --> 25:04.086
Interim guardian?

25:04.169 --> 25:06.380
Why? This shouldn't come as a surprise.

25:06.463 --> 25:09.925
Uncle trusts me above all,
even bypassing his own immediate family.

25:10.009 --> 25:11.927
Why the sudden fit,
like you had no idea?

25:12.011 --> 25:14.096
That mouth of yours has no lid.

25:14.638 --> 25:17.516
It's time to start minding
that tongue of yours.

25:17.599 --> 25:19.727
Media exposure is
only going to increase from here.

25:20.394 --> 25:22.896
The official Songjin Resort
meeting this week.

25:22.980 --> 25:24.815
Will you be attending?

25:24.898 --> 25:26.567
Of course.

25:26.650 --> 25:28.986
I'm in charge of it.
Why wouldn't I be there?

25:30.571 --> 25:31.572
Yeah, okay.

25:31.655 --> 25:32.990
I'll see you at the meeting then.

25:40.164 --> 25:44.793
DAEBAK BOARDING HOUSE

25:48.547 --> 25:50.424
You were back in Joseon.

25:50.507 --> 25:53.927
You said your name was Kang Dan-sim.

25:54.011 --> 25:55.804
That seals it.

25:55.888 --> 25:57.139
Hey, Rooftop!

25:57.222 --> 25:58.515
Where have you been?

25:59.183 --> 26:00.392
Your place right now…

26:01.307 --> 26:04.897
DIE

26:04.980 --> 26:06.065
When did this happen?

26:06.148 --> 26:08.650
This wasn't here yesterday.

26:08.734 --> 26:11.779
When I came out to shoo away
the birds that kept pooping,

26:11.862 --> 26:13.072
I found it like this.

26:13.155 --> 26:15.657
Maybe there's a curse on the building?

26:15.741 --> 26:17.993
First, the lightbulbs broke,

26:18.077 --> 26:20.245
and now there's graffiti.

26:20.329 --> 26:21.789
The way I see it,

26:21.872 --> 26:24.333
this wasn't done by one of our residents.

26:24.416 --> 26:25.959
It's definitely an outsider's doing.

26:26.043 --> 26:28.212
I should talk to the landlord about this.

26:28.295 --> 26:30.631
Maybe I should request
a door lock for the main entrance?

26:30.714 --> 26:31.840
That will never happen.

26:31.924 --> 26:32.966
Have I been

26:33.801 --> 26:35.010
under surveillance all along?

26:35.094 --> 26:37.221
What? Surveillance?

26:37.304 --> 26:38.388
By who?

26:48.547 --> 26:51.110
DAEBAK BOARDING HOUSE

26:58.150 --> 27:00.714
SPRAY PAINT

27:00.786 --> 27:02.871
This is truly sinister.

27:02.955 --> 27:04.957
What did they even use?
It's not even coming off.

27:05.040 --> 27:06.291
My poor back!

27:07.459 --> 27:09.795
I told you to leave the heavy stuff.

27:09.878 --> 27:11.463
Back injuries are no joke.

27:11.547 --> 27:13.841
We have to move this quickly
so we can sleep. I'm exhausted.

27:13.924 --> 27:15.425
That's why you should move tomorrow.

27:15.509 --> 27:17.594
Why move in the middle of the night?

27:17.678 --> 27:19.263
Would you be able to sleep here?

27:19.346 --> 27:20.681
They even wrote "Die" on the wall.

27:20.764 --> 27:22.850
They could easily bring
a sword to my throat at night.

27:22.933 --> 27:25.018
What if I get unlucky
and end up with a scar?

27:25.102 --> 27:26.311
I am a celebrity, after all.

27:26.395 --> 27:29.106
You go to extremes in everything you do.

27:29.189 --> 27:31.150
You overthink.
Is that why you're an actor?

27:31.233 --> 27:32.192
Stop.

27:32.276 --> 27:34.194
You better watch your mouth.

27:34.278 --> 27:35.863
-What?
-You better not breathe a word

27:35.946 --> 27:37.823
about what happened today
to Cha Se-gye.

27:37.906 --> 27:39.616
I do not want him worried for no reason.

27:41.410 --> 27:43.245
How are single people supposed to cope?

27:43.328 --> 27:45.080
Living in this dirty hell of couples.

27:45.164 --> 27:46.832
I heard Chairman Cha woke up.

27:47.541 --> 27:48.917
-Have you visited?
-No.

27:49.918 --> 27:52.504
Not yet. I had some things to sort out.

27:52.588 --> 27:54.923
Good. I looked into it,
and I hear Chairman Cha is dealing

27:55.007 --> 27:56.842
with some post-accident complications.

27:56.925 --> 27:58.218
Something's not right over there.

27:58.302 --> 27:59.595
I think it'd be best

28:00.179 --> 28:01.555
to wrap it all up now.

28:01.638 --> 28:04.057
That's not what I meant
when I said "sort out."

28:04.141 --> 28:05.726
Really? Then what did you mean?

28:05.809 --> 28:06.935
Mom, do you remember?

28:07.019 --> 28:09.229
Ye-jin, who tutored me
in my senior year of high school.

28:09.313 --> 28:12.149
She attended a top university
despite her poor background.

28:12.232 --> 28:14.109
You used to praise her a lot.

28:15.736 --> 28:18.280
I went to the department store
with a friend after finals,

28:18.363 --> 28:19.948
and I saw her there.

28:20.032 --> 28:22.826
She walked by
while affectionately holding Dad's hand.

28:23.452 --> 28:26.705
When I saw her the next day,
I slapped her, and then she told me

28:26.788 --> 28:27.998
that you knew everything.

28:28.081 --> 28:30.334
That you even paid her
to get lost at the right time.

28:30.417 --> 28:31.543
That's enough.

28:32.544 --> 28:34.880
Between the two of you,
I understood you even less.

28:34.963 --> 28:36.089
Why do you live like that?

28:36.173 --> 28:38.508
How are you okay
with just holding on to an empty shell?

28:42.971 --> 28:44.431
But you know what's funny?

28:44.514 --> 28:47.476
I think I'm starting to understand
why you lived like a fool all these years.

28:47.559 --> 28:49.770
Why you foolishly held on

28:49.853 --> 28:51.521
and couldn't let go.

28:53.273 --> 28:55.442
Grandfather, I'm here.

28:55.525 --> 28:57.319
Gosh. You're here.

28:58.779 --> 29:00.405
I bought some fruit.

29:01.031 --> 29:02.241
My goodness.

29:02.783 --> 29:05.202
-Did you even have time to eat today?
-No.

29:05.702 --> 29:06.787
I haven't yet.

29:07.913 --> 29:09.373
I don't want to let go.

29:09.915 --> 29:11.166
It's so annoying.

29:12.626 --> 29:15.128
It is like reaching for tears
and getting a slap on the face.

29:17.798 --> 29:19.633
This is actually for the better.

29:19.716 --> 29:21.760
It is a good chance
to sort out my next move.

29:45.909 --> 29:48.745
In about 15 days,
it will leave Earth's orbit

29:48.829 --> 29:51.623
and vanish once more
into the unknown darkness

29:51.707 --> 29:53.583
of the far side of the universe.

29:57.546 --> 29:58.630
Fifteen days.

30:02.384 --> 30:04.094
So, what should we do for our 100th day?

30:04.803 --> 30:06.847
Let me know
so I can prepare everything again.

30:06.930 --> 30:08.223
Our 100th day?

30:10.517 --> 30:13.270
Our 100th day will be in the spring
when flowers bloom, right?

30:13.353 --> 30:16.189
Then let us go see
the cornelian cherry flowers.

30:16.273 --> 30:18.233
We can make
some flower pancakes with the flowers.

30:18.317 --> 30:19.276
-Flower pancakes?
-Yeah.

30:19.943 --> 30:23.113
And in the summer,
we can plant trumpet vines in the yard.

30:23.196 --> 30:25.449
Or we can go to the sea
for the beach roses.

30:25.532 --> 30:27.951
Are you possessed
by a flower spirit or something?

30:28.452 --> 30:30.037
You want to see every flower there is.

30:31.079 --> 30:34.166
In the fall, we have to make
flower crowns with chrysanthemums,

30:34.249 --> 30:36.043
so we should plant some in the yard too.

30:36.585 --> 30:37.627
Right?

30:41.298 --> 30:42.257
Don't kid yourself.

30:49.181 --> 30:50.474
That's not you.

30:52.642 --> 30:54.019
You're just a fake.

30:56.313 --> 30:57.647
Get out of my body.

31:02.069 --> 31:04.654
Seo-ri, my sweet girl.

31:09.659 --> 31:12.204
Don't kid yourself. That's not you.

31:14.039 --> 31:15.248
I know.

31:16.416 --> 31:17.876
I do…

31:21.671 --> 31:23.173
I must not dare to hope.

31:30.497 --> 31:33.811
CHA SE-GYE

31:38.397 --> 31:40.649
The caller you are trying
to reach is unavailable…

31:48.532 --> 31:49.408
MISSED CALL
CHA SE-GYE

31:49.491 --> 31:51.868
Call me when you see this.
I'll be waiting.

31:56.415 --> 31:58.166
CHA SE-GYE: CALL ME WHEN YOU SEE THIS

32:02.712 --> 32:04.381
If I leave without a word,

32:04.965 --> 32:06.633
you will also end up waiting for me.

32:08.093 --> 32:10.137
YEONGHWI CHAMBER

32:14.307 --> 32:16.143
Foolishly, just like I had,

32:17.519 --> 32:19.187
you will wait endlessly

32:20.188 --> 32:21.565
as you wither away.

32:24.776 --> 32:27.028
Word has come that the Grand Prince

32:27.112 --> 32:29.364
has breathed his last in exile.

32:56.141 --> 32:58.185
To make sure you smile
when you think of me,

32:58.685 --> 33:00.770
just as I picture you smiling
when I miss you.

33:04.691 --> 33:06.485
I shall convey this heart in full

33:07.068 --> 33:08.653
and hold nothing back.

33:09.154 --> 33:10.906
So you will not wither away alone.

33:12.282 --> 33:13.325
Right.

33:14.075 --> 33:15.619
This is not the time for tears.

33:18.788 --> 33:22.292
CHA SE-GYE

33:22.417 --> 33:23.585
Hello?

33:23.668 --> 33:26.087
Cha Se-gye, it is I, Shin Seo-ri.

33:28.215 --> 33:29.925
Is Grandfather okay?

33:30.008 --> 33:31.301
He's fine, of course.

33:31.384 --> 33:32.886
He's full of energy.

33:32.969 --> 33:34.429
He was worried about you,

33:34.513 --> 33:36.431
but I told him you were perfectly fine.

33:37.766 --> 33:39.184
He asked that you visit soon.

33:41.144 --> 33:42.771
He asked for me?

33:47.359 --> 33:48.777
Then, before that,

33:50.195 --> 33:51.530
should we maybe

33:52.197 --> 33:53.740
go somewhere nice tomorrow?

33:53.823 --> 33:55.575
-Somewhere nice?
-You know,

33:56.201 --> 33:58.537
we have not been on a proper date yet.

33:58.620 --> 34:00.830
Last time, we only went
where I wanted to go.

34:00.914 --> 34:02.290
So this time,

34:02.374 --> 34:04.251
let us go where you want to go.

34:05.168 --> 34:06.294
I shall follow you anywhere.

34:06.378 --> 34:08.547
Who knows where I might take you?

34:09.881 --> 34:11.007
So bold.

34:11.591 --> 34:12.926
Anyway,

34:13.009 --> 34:14.511
let us go somewhere tomorrow.

34:15.011 --> 34:16.555
Take the night to think about where.

34:17.889 --> 34:18.765
Hello?

34:20.100 --> 34:21.101
Jeez.

34:21.643 --> 34:23.562
So aggressive.

34:24.104 --> 34:25.438
I was planning to steal you away.

34:29.150 --> 34:30.443
How could you beat me to it?

34:38.868 --> 34:40.120
Was I sleepwalking?

34:41.538 --> 34:43.373
How do you like your hair today?

34:43.456 --> 34:44.583
I tried extra hard today.

34:46.418 --> 34:47.460
Give it here.

34:49.963 --> 34:51.715
Charity events

34:51.798 --> 34:54.092
call for that wholesome look.

34:54.175 --> 34:55.176
Yeah.

34:56.511 --> 34:57.846
Like this.

35:02.350 --> 35:03.685
Yeah? Done.

35:04.436 --> 35:06.521
-You can go.
-Okay.

35:09.733 --> 35:12.694
So your fling with Gong Tae-woo
was really just a rumor.

35:12.777 --> 35:15.488
I thought Han Min-hui was fake,
and you were the real deal.

35:15.572 --> 35:18.533
I thought you two were secretly dating
since filming that movie.

35:19.159 --> 35:21.536
Are you nuts? Why would I date
a thug like Gong Tae-woo?

35:21.620 --> 35:24.414
And I really don't like younger guys.

35:24.497 --> 35:25.373
Really?

35:25.457 --> 35:27.667
Hey, if you don't like younger guys,

35:27.751 --> 35:29.002
how about a half-celebrity?

35:29.711 --> 35:31.004
Shin Seo-ri's manager.

35:31.963 --> 35:33.256
You guys looked good together.

35:34.507 --> 35:35.759
Are you insane?

35:35.842 --> 35:37.427
Half-celebrity? Please.

35:37.510 --> 35:40.639
Even if he has some money,
a manager is still a manager.

35:41.181 --> 35:43.767
-Is he well off?
-What do his parents do?

35:43.850 --> 35:45.477
-What neighborhood?
-Well,

35:46.061 --> 35:47.646
I heard they run a business or something.

35:47.729 --> 35:50.315
I said no.
Why would I take over that business?

35:50.398 --> 35:51.608
I thought this was settled.

35:53.568 --> 35:55.403
He always has his nose up in the air.

35:55.487 --> 35:57.614
He'll never be a manager
with that attitude.

35:57.697 --> 35:58.698
I said no.

35:58.782 --> 36:01.618
I will never take over
Father's department store.

36:02.243 --> 36:03.203
Jeez.

36:06.373 --> 36:07.290
"Department store"?

36:07.916 --> 36:09.709
But a department store in the countryside?

36:09.793 --> 36:12.295
It's probably just a bit bigger
than a neighborhood supermarket?

36:12.379 --> 36:13.630
You don't know anything.

36:13.713 --> 36:16.299
Department stores in the countryside
are where it's at.

36:16.383 --> 36:18.176
They literally rake in the money.

36:18.259 --> 36:20.470
Yeah, a cousin of mine

36:20.553 --> 36:22.305
married the son of Gumi Department Store.

36:22.389 --> 36:23.973
She's totally set for life now.

36:24.057 --> 36:26.476
She rides supercars every day,
swapping them by color.

36:26.559 --> 36:28.520
Shin Seo-ri, that sly fox.

36:28.603 --> 36:30.563
She's been sitting on that golden ticket?

36:32.565 --> 36:34.693
I told you no.

36:34.776 --> 36:36.903
I'm not doing it. I won't.

36:38.655 --> 36:41.783
This punk always hangs up on me.

36:41.866 --> 36:42.867
Ma'am, how much is this?

36:42.951 --> 36:44.285
Didn't you see our sign?

36:44.369 --> 36:46.538
Everything here is a thousand won.

36:46.621 --> 36:49.999
THOUSAND WON DEPARTMENT STORE

36:50.083 --> 36:51.835
Hey, Mr. Department Store is here.

37:11.521 --> 37:12.731
What are you guys doing?

37:59.319 --> 38:01.362
I thought you didn't like it,
but you're wearing it.

38:04.157 --> 38:06.201
When did I say I did not like it?

38:06.284 --> 38:07.452
I just called it a leash.

38:07.535 --> 38:10.497
But where are we going right now?

38:11.080 --> 38:13.041
Should I have packed an overnight bag?

38:16.377 --> 38:18.087
Who's the devilish one now?

38:19.130 --> 38:22.217
After a night at my place,
an overnight trip is nothing now?

38:23.843 --> 38:25.553
What are you talking about?

38:27.597 --> 38:29.682
We'll have to save
the overnight for next time.

38:29.766 --> 38:31.518
Just think of today as meeting the family.

38:32.560 --> 38:33.436
Meeting the family?

38:33.520 --> 38:34.938
We're on our way to see my mom.

38:37.774 --> 38:41.152
REST IN PEACE, HAN HYE-SEON

38:45.240 --> 38:46.366
Well?

38:47.534 --> 38:49.661
-Isn't my mom beautiful?
-Yeah.

38:51.079 --> 38:53.623
Incredibly beautiful and elegant.

38:53.706 --> 38:56.167
I never understood why guys
wanted their families

38:56.251 --> 38:57.961
to meet their girlfriends,

38:58.044 --> 38:59.754
but now I do.

39:00.380 --> 39:01.923
I wanted to show you off.

39:02.715 --> 39:04.259
My pretty girlfriend.

39:05.385 --> 39:06.803
You should have told me beforehand.

39:07.679 --> 39:09.097
I would have dressed up nicer.

39:09.180 --> 39:10.557
You're perfect.

39:10.640 --> 39:12.058
How much nicer could you look?

39:12.141 --> 39:13.852
Are you trying to show my mom up?

39:14.394 --> 39:16.187
Mom has something to say. Hold on.

39:19.858 --> 39:20.984
She says she's prettier.

39:21.526 --> 39:22.777
She says not to worry.

39:37.250 --> 39:39.669
This is the last place I came
with Mom when I was little.

39:39.752 --> 39:41.754
Looking at it now, it's so tiny.

39:42.922 --> 39:44.632
Why did you never come back as an adult?

39:45.550 --> 39:46.843
Worried you might think of her?

39:50.597 --> 39:51.598
No.

39:54.267 --> 39:55.435
I was afraid I'd get weak.

39:56.936 --> 39:59.272
Thinking of Mom just makes me
feel some kind of way.

40:01.065 --> 40:02.442
It brings me down sometimes.

40:04.027 --> 40:05.737
Mom was pretty sick when I was young.

40:06.404 --> 40:08.406
But she lied to me.

40:09.198 --> 40:10.491
She said she'd get healthy

40:10.575 --> 40:12.201
and come back for me.

40:13.870 --> 40:14.913
She told me to wait.

40:26.174 --> 40:27.050
Se-gye.

40:29.385 --> 40:30.303
Cha Se-gye.

40:34.223 --> 40:35.224
Come here, Se-gye.

40:44.150 --> 40:45.485
My dear Se-gye.

40:45.568 --> 40:46.986
Just wait a little bit.

40:50.698 --> 40:52.283
I'll come back for you.

40:52.825 --> 40:56.454
I only realized much later
that she couldn't come for me.

40:57.580 --> 40:59.207
But I didn't know that at the time.

40:59.290 --> 41:02.168
I just sat by that window,
waiting for her every day.

41:02.251 --> 41:03.336
Before waiting some more.

41:08.257 --> 41:10.343
Would it have been better
if I'd known the truth?

41:15.139 --> 41:16.849
I don't even know anymore.

41:19.060 --> 41:20.728
I think knowing the truth is better.

41:23.022 --> 41:25.400
-What?
-Because waiting without knowing the end…

41:27.735 --> 41:28.820
is just too hard.

41:35.535 --> 41:36.828
Cha Se-gye.

41:40.039 --> 41:42.542
I do not want to lie to you.

41:42.625 --> 41:44.961
I do not want to make you wait endlessly.

41:45.628 --> 41:47.422
That is why I am telling you this.

41:49.549 --> 41:50.842
I am going back.

41:52.760 --> 41:54.012
Going back?

41:58.182 --> 41:59.517
I have to go back

42:00.393 --> 42:01.602
to where I came from.

42:09.068 --> 42:12.363
So let us do everything we can,
starting today.

42:12.447 --> 42:14.907
One by one, so we do not have regrets.

42:18.703 --> 42:19.871
What is this?

42:19.954 --> 42:21.289
Are you making fun of me?

42:21.956 --> 42:23.332
I believed all this nonsense

42:23.416 --> 42:25.835
about reincarnation
and transcending time and space,

42:26.502 --> 42:27.628
and now you're leaving?

42:28.504 --> 42:29.922
You're just going to leave?

42:32.592 --> 42:33.593
Cha Se-gye.

42:33.676 --> 42:35.970
At least try to make some sense.

42:36.054 --> 42:38.723
If you're leaving, when are you going?
In a month? Two months?

42:40.349 --> 42:42.185
-That is--
-Why? Is there no deadline?

42:42.268 --> 42:43.770
Haven't you set a date?

42:44.520 --> 42:46.439
I am not sure either.

42:47.148 --> 42:48.983
Probably around two weeks.

42:51.402 --> 42:53.654
-I guess there is one.
-I know this is hard for you.

42:54.197 --> 42:55.448
I know it very well.

42:55.948 --> 42:58.868
That is why I'm not hiding it
and telling you the truth for your sake.

42:58.951 --> 43:00.286
For my sake?

43:00.369 --> 43:03.331
So you asked me out on a date today
to tell me that nonsense?

43:04.082 --> 43:05.083
You…

43:06.584 --> 43:07.710
Do you think…

43:09.712 --> 43:11.380
it is easy for me to tell you this?

43:13.216 --> 43:15.676
Then what do you want? Applause?

43:15.760 --> 43:18.179
Should I get you a palanquin
so you can return in glory?

43:18.262 --> 43:20.640
What did you possibly expect from me

43:20.723 --> 43:22.725
when you came to me with such nonsense?

43:24.310 --> 43:25.937
-You…
-Why mess with me like this

43:26.020 --> 43:27.939
if you were just going to leave anyway?

43:28.022 --> 43:30.733
You turned someone barely holding it
together into a lovesick moron.

43:30.817 --> 43:31.943
Right now, I…

43:32.026 --> 43:33.152
No, you can't go.

43:34.070 --> 43:35.404
I refuse, so just know that.

43:35.488 --> 43:36.614
Cha Se-gye.

43:37.782 --> 43:38.658
No.

43:39.867 --> 43:42.703
I'm the crazy one for believing
everything you said until now.

43:44.122 --> 43:45.623
We're going to see a doctor tomorrow.

43:45.706 --> 43:47.500
We'll get an EEG or whatever.

43:47.583 --> 43:50.086
Just get a full checkup,
and then we can talk.

43:50.753 --> 43:51.838
This is just…

43:53.631 --> 43:54.841
Damn it.

44:09.605 --> 44:11.482
I do not want to leave either.

44:13.651 --> 44:15.862
I want to stay by your side.

45:10.872 --> 45:13.336
MY AMAZING FAN

45:25.848 --> 45:27.975
If only I could take it with me.

45:28.059 --> 45:31.020
Then I would have something to look at

45:31.103 --> 45:33.105
from time to time.

45:55.044 --> 45:58.339
From now on, I want all the money
coming to me to be deposited here.

45:58.422 --> 45:59.507
Please.

46:04.345 --> 46:06.138
NAM OK-SUN
SONGJIN GENERAL HOSPITAL

46:07.056 --> 46:08.432
Are you going somewhere?

46:08.516 --> 46:11.894
Now that the drama is over,
are you going on a trip or something?

46:12.937 --> 46:13.896
A trip?

46:13.980 --> 46:15.523
Actually, I'm glad you're here today.

46:16.065 --> 46:18.943
You should have this picture.

46:19.026 --> 46:20.152
Picture?

46:21.404 --> 46:23.155
I found it while cleaning the storage.

46:35.084 --> 46:36.752
I'll pay you back soon.

46:36.836 --> 46:38.796
Seo-ri, my dearest daughter.

46:38.879 --> 46:40.339
When you wake up from your nap,

46:41.257 --> 46:42.341
we should be home.

46:44.719 --> 46:46.220
I was right.

46:47.763 --> 46:49.348
That was a childhood memory.

46:49.432 --> 46:50.641
Do you remember?

46:55.855 --> 46:57.106
She will be back soon.

46:58.399 --> 46:59.942
Once I am gone.

47:03.237 --> 47:05.323
My name is Dan-sim.

47:05.406 --> 47:06.991
Kang Dan-sim.

47:07.074 --> 47:09.076
That tone…

47:13.831 --> 47:15.875
What is your name?

47:15.958 --> 47:17.793
My name is Dan-sim.

47:17.877 --> 47:18.836
Kang Dan-sim.

47:21.756 --> 47:24.383
Just as I thought. Her tone…

47:25.968 --> 47:27.636
I don't think it's Her Highness.

47:30.389 --> 47:32.308
Maybe she's not going back?

47:32.391 --> 47:33.434
Here is our next story.

47:33.517 --> 47:36.479
According to the BBC,
five Joseon-era artifacts

47:36.562 --> 47:40.024
currently held at the British Museum
are set to be repatriated.

47:40.107 --> 47:43.027
Among the items to be returned
is reportedly a diary belonging

47:43.110 --> 47:46.072
to Grand Prince Cheongheon,
the younger brother of Anjong of Joseon,

47:46.155 --> 47:49.075
who is also known
as the "ill-fated prince."

47:49.700 --> 47:51.327
The diary is currently…

47:51.410 --> 47:53.727
How does it feel to be heading
into the heart of the enemy?

47:53.829 --> 47:56.540
-…a painting of a court lady…
-For a formal meeting and not an ambush.

47:56.624 --> 47:57.875
No reason to fuss.

47:57.958 --> 47:59.668
When did feelings get in the way of work?

47:59.752 --> 48:02.505
…lending weight
to the academic hypothesis.

48:06.342 --> 48:07.385
Step on it.

48:08.344 --> 48:10.596
Choi Mun-do must be
waiting anxiously for us.

48:11.389 --> 48:13.474
I would like to thank
all the executives for attending

48:13.557 --> 48:15.643
the first official meeting
for Songjin Resort today.

48:15.726 --> 48:18.253
The fact that you took time
out of your busy schedules

48:18.353 --> 48:21.607
shows that you support this project
and believe this will bring forth

48:21.690 --> 48:23.984
a new era for Chail.
I appreciate it greatly.

48:25.778 --> 48:27.863
Now, shall we begin the meeting?

48:34.286 --> 48:36.163
Wow…

48:36.247 --> 48:38.249
They're ostracizing me now.

48:38.332 --> 48:40.668
Ms. Nam Ok-sun's bills are fully paid.

48:40.751 --> 48:43.587
She's registered for automatic payments
under Mr. Cha Se-gye.

48:43.671 --> 48:45.673
We actually needed
her guardian's consent anyway.

48:45.756 --> 48:47.425
You can do it now.

48:52.138 --> 48:53.264
Then this too.

48:54.056 --> 48:55.474
Have this account be linked as well.

48:55.558 --> 48:59.186
So she can be well taken care of
even if you cannot reach me.

48:59.270 --> 49:00.855
Please.

49:07.945 --> 49:11.157
She's registered for automatic payments
under Mr. Cha Se-gye.

49:12.950 --> 49:15.578
Why mess with me like this
if you were just going to leave anyway?

49:16.370 --> 49:18.956
You turned someone barely holding it
together into a lovesick moron.

49:19.039 --> 49:20.291
Right now, I…

49:20.916 --> 49:22.042
You jerk.

49:22.877 --> 49:24.128
How could you say that?

49:26.172 --> 49:29.467
Then again, I am the worst one of all.

49:30.759 --> 49:32.428
Saying goodbye with a smile…

49:34.346 --> 49:35.931
I am one greedy wench.

50:03.000 --> 50:04.126
She is not in her room.

50:04.210 --> 50:05.377
The patient is missing!

50:05.461 --> 50:06.921
No need to panic.

50:07.004 --> 50:10.216
She didn't disappear. She just went
for a short walk right out front.

50:11.842 --> 50:14.637
Ma'am, do you have a moment?

50:14.720 --> 50:16.805
You should speak to her doctor.

50:30.861 --> 50:32.530
Why are you out in the cold?

50:33.239 --> 50:34.365
What if you catch a cold?

50:34.448 --> 50:37.409
It's fun sitting here like this.

50:38.118 --> 50:42.248
Watching people get on and off the bus
keeps me from getting bored.

50:42.957 --> 50:44.083
Why?

50:45.167 --> 50:47.169
Do you like seeing people out and about?

50:49.421 --> 50:50.589
No, it's not that.

50:51.715 --> 50:53.300
Actually…

50:55.135 --> 50:58.556
my dream when I was a kid
was to be a driver.

51:00.599 --> 51:03.602
Other kids wanted to be the bus guides.

51:03.686 --> 51:06.605
But I really wanted to be the driver.

51:07.690 --> 51:10.859
Gosh. Driving all day in a car,

51:11.402 --> 51:13.279
having a blast,

51:13.362 --> 51:16.532
making money, and seeing the world
to my heart's content.

51:16.615 --> 51:18.450
Living life on your own terms is enviable.

51:19.076 --> 51:21.453
I was so envious of that.

51:21.537 --> 51:23.163
A little disappointed I couldn't.

51:26.709 --> 51:28.627
Now, the next item on the agenda

51:28.711 --> 51:30.713
is the most important issue.

51:34.300 --> 51:35.384
Securing the site.

51:35.467 --> 51:37.344
Earlier at the groundbreaking ceremony,

51:37.428 --> 51:39.763
press releases went out saying
the site was fully secured,

51:39.847 --> 51:42.600
but the plot near the resort entrance
hasn't been purchased yet.

51:42.683 --> 51:45.978
The site purchase needs to be completed
before construction begins,

51:46.061 --> 51:48.105
but the owner of this plot
is very stubborn.

51:48.188 --> 51:49.648
You don't worry about that.

51:50.441 --> 51:52.818
The head of our new TF team
will take care of it.

51:53.360 --> 51:54.903
Isn't that right, Mr. Cha?

51:59.116 --> 52:00.492
What?

52:00.576 --> 52:03.829
I guess it hasn't been shared
with the executives yet.

52:03.912 --> 52:05.706
Thanks to Mr. Cha Se-gye's connections,

52:05.789 --> 52:08.584
we have successfully signed
a contract with the restaurant owner.

52:13.255 --> 52:14.465
SEORI'S NOODLE SHOP

52:14.548 --> 52:16.800
Thanks to the legwork he put in,

52:16.884 --> 52:19.428
we have finally secured 100% of the site.

52:20.179 --> 52:21.639
Please give him a round of applause.

52:38.530 --> 52:39.823
That's a good age.

52:41.283 --> 52:42.785
But they don't know that.

52:43.702 --> 52:46.491
-I'll have tteokbokki.
-Let's add one serving of beef brisket.

52:46.580 --> 52:49.833
I thought I'd be
young like that forever too.

52:49.917 --> 52:53.379
But I blinked, and I became an old lady.

52:54.004 --> 52:56.006
I was so busy rolling all that dough.

52:56.882 --> 52:58.592
I didn't know my hair had gone gray.

53:02.054 --> 53:04.098
But still,

53:04.181 --> 53:06.600
that doesn't mean
I didn't like running the restaurant.

53:06.684 --> 53:09.478
Watching kids enjoy my noodles

53:09.561 --> 53:10.938
made me full too.

53:11.438 --> 53:13.899
That's why I didn't stop working.

53:16.485 --> 53:17.444
But now,

53:18.237 --> 53:19.780
that's all over too.

53:21.740 --> 53:23.867
I should slowly start wrapping things up.

53:25.744 --> 53:27.996
Is it because
of the restaurant demolition?

53:28.497 --> 53:29.998
I will try to take care of that--

53:30.082 --> 53:31.709
No, look at me.

53:31.792 --> 53:33.168
How do I look to you?

53:34.002 --> 53:35.671
Do you think I can run a restaurant again?

53:37.256 --> 53:40.342
Ms. Nam Ok-sun is not doing well.

53:40.426 --> 53:42.094
While we couldn't reach you,

53:42.177 --> 53:44.346
her cognitive function
has dropped rapidly.

53:44.430 --> 53:46.235
As well as her physical function.

53:46.306 --> 53:48.684
You should probably prepare yourself…

53:49.685 --> 53:50.686
Prepare myself?

53:51.311 --> 53:53.522
She doesn't have much time left.

53:54.940 --> 53:57.693
Of course you can. Why not?

53:59.153 --> 54:00.237
No.

54:00.821 --> 54:02.906
I only held on to it all this time

54:02.990 --> 54:05.159
out of greed and sentiment.

54:09.413 --> 54:10.789
It's okay.

54:11.498 --> 54:12.750
Don't worry about it.

54:14.334 --> 54:16.545
Hey, it's cold out today.

54:17.254 --> 54:20.215
Why are you wearing such thin clothes?

54:22.259 --> 54:24.803
Your hands are so cold. Jeez.

54:25.554 --> 54:26.597
My granddaughter

54:27.806 --> 54:30.058
always goes around with her hands
freezing like this too.

54:30.726 --> 54:32.269
In a little bit,

54:32.770 --> 54:33.729
the sun will set.

54:34.688 --> 54:36.148
She's late.

54:54.208 --> 54:55.834
Miss, you must be cold.

54:55.918 --> 54:59.671
Here. Put this on, at least. Go on.

55:01.340 --> 55:02.549
Here you go.

55:02.633 --> 55:05.511
I'll lend it to you until my bus comes.

55:06.470 --> 55:08.555
My granddaughter bought this for me.

55:09.264 --> 55:10.390
How is it?

55:10.474 --> 55:15.062
Doesn't it feel a bit better wrapped up
all warm and cozy like this?

55:16.021 --> 55:17.356
It's pretty.

55:18.816 --> 55:20.192
No, I am…

55:23.654 --> 55:25.113
I am not…

55:28.075 --> 55:29.409
Miss, why are you crying?

55:29.493 --> 55:32.079
Are you upset about something?

55:34.248 --> 55:38.460
Oh my. You'll lose your energy
if you cry like this.

55:38.544 --> 55:40.796
Please don't cry.

55:48.470 --> 55:50.222
What's wrong with me?

55:53.642 --> 55:56.937
Why does my chest hurt so much?

56:00.899 --> 56:03.235
Don't cry, okay?

56:05.320 --> 56:07.990
Don't cry…

56:22.421 --> 56:23.755
It hurts.

56:23.839 --> 56:26.633
Don't cry…

56:28.844 --> 56:30.220
Don't cry.

56:32.264 --> 56:34.391
Don't cry.

56:36.393 --> 56:38.437
Don't cry.

56:42.357 --> 56:44.234
You can't go in right now…

56:55.871 --> 56:57.122
So this is what you wanted?

56:57.205 --> 56:59.333
You just wanted me to walk out on my own?

57:00.042 --> 57:01.919
No, why would you leave?

57:02.002 --> 57:03.754
I already told the Chairman

57:03.837 --> 57:06.965
to watch closely as you prove yourself
with the chance you were given.

57:07.049 --> 57:08.175
To see

57:08.800 --> 57:10.302
what our Crown Prince chooses.

57:10.385 --> 57:11.511
What?

57:11.595 --> 57:13.013
I guess you don't know this yet,

57:13.096 --> 57:15.390
but I'm more compassionate than I look.

57:15.474 --> 57:16.600
Look at me right now.

57:16.683 --> 57:19.353
I'm giving you a chance
to regain Uncle's trust.

57:19.436 --> 57:20.938
And also a chance

57:21.772 --> 57:23.315
to win love.

57:23.398 --> 57:25.025
Whatever you do, you'll gain something.

57:25.108 --> 57:27.439
Is there a reason to be this mad at me?

57:28.362 --> 57:30.072
Look at you having a blast.

57:30.155 --> 57:32.074
Your eyes light up
when you play with people.

57:32.157 --> 57:33.909
Yeah, I'll admit it.

57:34.534 --> 57:35.869
It is fun.

57:40.082 --> 57:42.542
But you should probably hurry up now.

57:45.087 --> 57:46.922
If you decide to choose her,

57:47.422 --> 57:48.590
you don't have much time left.

57:48.674 --> 57:49.633
What time?

57:49.716 --> 57:52.386
The demolition team should be heading
to the site right now.

57:53.303 --> 57:55.013
They'll arrive before sunset.

57:59.351 --> 58:02.479
I told them to demolish
the entrance plot first.

58:02.562 --> 58:06.108
To wipe out
that messy commercial area first.

58:07.359 --> 58:08.443
Well?

58:08.527 --> 58:10.153
Shouldn't you go and check on her?

58:10.237 --> 58:11.655
You bastard.

58:15.492 --> 58:17.119
There we go.

58:17.202 --> 58:18.620
This is the Cha Se-gye I know.

58:18.704 --> 58:22.249
Throwing punches without thinking
and cursing up a storm.

58:22.332 --> 58:24.251
Only knowing how to throw a tantrum.

58:24.334 --> 58:25.585
You really

58:26.545 --> 58:29.172
have never wanted for anything.

58:29.756 --> 58:32.759
Just a kid running wild
without knowing how the world works.

58:54.197 --> 58:55.449
Fine.

58:57.701 --> 58:58.744
Do whatever you want.

59:01.038 --> 59:04.249
Do whatever you want with the company.
Tear it apart or destroy it.

59:04.332 --> 59:07.586
But that messy restaurant spot
isn't important at all.

59:08.879 --> 59:10.756
You can easily just leave it alone.

59:12.591 --> 59:15.135
I haven't done a single thing right
for that woman.

59:15.218 --> 59:17.095
So just leave that alone.

59:19.222 --> 59:20.265
Is that an order?

59:21.600 --> 59:22.851
Or a favor?

59:24.269 --> 59:25.479
Pick one.

59:30.442 --> 59:31.985
If you step on me, I'll let you.

59:32.486 --> 59:33.987
If you tell me to bow, I will.

59:34.071 --> 59:35.489
So just let that one thing go.

59:36.198 --> 59:38.408
To us, it may be a messy,
insignificant restaurant,

59:38.492 --> 59:41.203
but for someone else,
it's their home and their life.

59:43.288 --> 59:44.372
So just spare them that.

59:46.374 --> 59:47.793
I'm begging you.

59:56.009 --> 59:58.303
I thought you were a kid,
but you're a man.

59:59.930 --> 01:00:02.182
Now we can finally talk.

01:00:02.265 --> 01:00:03.517
Right?

01:00:05.352 --> 01:00:06.812
But you know what, Se-gye?

01:00:08.021 --> 01:00:10.649
I gave the demolition team
special instructions.

01:00:12.067 --> 01:00:14.361
No matter who, no matter when…

01:00:14.903 --> 01:00:16.446
No matter what happens,

01:00:17.155 --> 01:00:19.282
they are to proceed.

01:00:21.326 --> 01:00:22.619
Too bad.

01:00:26.164 --> 01:00:27.207
Damn it.

01:00:30.669 --> 01:00:32.504
Damn child.

01:00:43.348 --> 01:00:44.266
Director Jang.

01:00:46.852 --> 01:00:48.145
Please follow me.

01:01:06.163 --> 01:01:07.205
Director Jang.

01:01:14.671 --> 01:01:16.256
Jang Seok-ho!

01:01:18.842 --> 01:01:20.010
Your Highness!

01:01:21.303 --> 01:01:22.846
-Excuse me.
-Where did she go?

01:01:25.098 --> 01:01:27.225
-What are you doing there?
-Her Highness.

01:01:27.309 --> 01:01:29.936
No, I mean. Where did Seo-ri go?

01:01:30.020 --> 01:01:31.688
She went to see her grandmother. Why?

01:01:32.397 --> 01:01:33.982
I need to tell her this.

01:01:34.065 --> 01:01:36.276
I need to let her know
as soon as possible.

01:01:36.359 --> 01:01:38.528
Why isn't she picking up her damn phone?

01:01:38.612 --> 01:01:41.072
What are you talking about?
You can tell me.

01:01:41.990 --> 01:01:42.908
No. It's--

01:01:42.991 --> 01:01:44.826
I'm her manager.

01:01:46.578 --> 01:01:47.787
Just tell me.

01:01:48.480 --> 01:01:50.994
SEORI'S NOODLE SHOP

01:02:00.467 --> 01:02:01.788
2025 TO 2026

01:02:20.779 --> 01:02:22.239
So meticulous.

01:02:27.452 --> 01:02:29.204
You know, I've been feeling good recently.

01:02:29.287 --> 01:02:32.082
Everything hit the fan,
but strangely, I feel good.

01:02:32.165 --> 01:02:33.458
You idiot.

01:02:33.541 --> 01:02:35.252
I think I needed something to hold on to.

01:02:35.335 --> 01:02:37.754
I had to hold on to something
to feel like I was alive.

01:02:38.964 --> 01:02:41.007
All caught up in your own damn feelings.

01:02:41.508 --> 01:02:42.509
I finally get it.

01:02:43.176 --> 01:02:44.386
What's really important.

01:02:44.886 --> 01:02:48.098
What I truly need.

01:02:49.349 --> 01:02:51.851
You don't know anything.

01:02:52.560 --> 01:02:53.645
I just…

01:02:54.688 --> 01:02:56.273
I just need you.

01:02:57.983 --> 01:03:01.069
I was completely oblivious to the despair

01:03:02.362 --> 01:03:03.905
you've shouldered alone.

01:03:08.535 --> 01:03:10.745
It's not cabbage. It's basically gold now.

01:03:10.829 --> 01:03:13.873
It's so ridiculous.
I might just start farming it myself.

01:03:15.417 --> 01:03:17.502
The sign across the street says
they're the original.

01:03:17.585 --> 01:03:20.797
The original kalguksu?
They're making me laugh nonstop.

01:03:21.840 --> 01:03:23.508
Half of this is just swearing.

01:03:25.051 --> 01:03:26.678
Such a foul mouth she has.

01:03:28.513 --> 01:03:29.723
Oh my, that little brat.

01:03:29.806 --> 01:03:32.600
When I told her to eat some carrots,
she threw a fit and pinched me.

01:03:32.684 --> 01:03:34.394
For a little thing,
she's got a strong grip.

01:03:44.529 --> 01:03:46.156
Grandma, I'm home.

01:03:46.239 --> 01:03:48.658
My sweet girl. You're home.

01:03:49.367 --> 01:03:50.618
-Let's eat some carrots!
-What?

01:03:50.702 --> 01:03:52.203
-Let's eat some carrots!
-I said no!

01:03:52.287 --> 01:03:53.496
-I don't want to!
-Come on!

01:03:53.580 --> 01:03:54.497
I hate carrots.

01:03:54.581 --> 01:03:57.334
That hurts! You little brat.

01:03:57.417 --> 01:03:58.626
My goodness.

01:04:08.136 --> 01:04:11.222
My Seo-ri is on TV.

01:04:11.765 --> 01:04:14.225
I was so excited that I gave
everything away for free today.

01:04:14.309 --> 01:04:15.977
Look at my sweet girl.

01:04:16.061 --> 01:04:19.856
I'm so glad Dong-seok took her to Seoul.

01:04:19.939 --> 01:04:21.941
He should have taken her sooner.

01:04:23.276 --> 01:04:26.029
My Seo-ri is on every time
I turn on the TV.

01:04:26.613 --> 01:04:28.740
I mean, I'm happy about it,

01:04:29.866 --> 01:04:32.744
but is she doing okay in school?

01:04:32.827 --> 01:04:33.953
Is she eating well?

01:04:34.496 --> 01:04:37.040
I'm worried because
she's as skinny as a skewer.

01:04:39.459 --> 01:04:41.002
I miss you.

01:04:49.386 --> 01:04:50.261
2002 TO 2003

01:04:56.768 --> 01:04:58.520
Her belly is cold.

01:04:58.603 --> 01:05:01.231
I'm worried because
she always has a stomachache.

01:05:02.190 --> 01:05:05.360
I should brew
some herbal medicine for her.

01:05:08.154 --> 01:05:10.073
Grandma.

01:05:10.156 --> 01:05:12.909
My tummy aches. Can I have a tummy rub?

01:05:12.992 --> 01:05:14.702
Do you have a stomachache again?

01:05:14.786 --> 01:05:15.829
Come here.

01:05:16.413 --> 01:05:17.664
Oh my.

01:05:17.747 --> 01:05:19.666
Grandma will give you her healing hands.

01:05:19.749 --> 01:05:24.337
Grandma's hands are healing hands

01:05:24.421 --> 01:05:27.715
Seo-ri's tummy is a potbelly

01:05:27.799 --> 01:05:30.176
Hey! I don't have a potbelly!

01:05:31.845 --> 01:05:36.015
Grandma's hands are healing hands

01:05:36.599 --> 01:05:40.395
Seo-ri's tummy is a potbelly

01:05:44.816 --> 01:05:46.025
What is this?

01:05:48.695 --> 01:05:51.322
They told me to wait.

01:05:53.700 --> 01:05:56.286
They said they'd be right back.

01:05:58.830 --> 01:06:01.708
They told me to wait here.

01:06:02.709 --> 01:06:04.043
What is wrong with me?

01:06:05.003 --> 01:06:06.546
But that's quite strange.

01:06:06.629 --> 01:06:09.424
Childhood memories
should have been borne away

01:06:09.507 --> 01:06:10.884
with the soul of the body's master.

01:06:10.967 --> 01:06:13.178
How did they stay and get tangled up?

01:06:13.261 --> 01:06:15.430
Why do I keep…

01:06:19.601 --> 01:06:23.146
Right. This is not my body,
and those are not my memories.

01:06:23.897 --> 01:06:25.398
How did they get tangled with my own?

01:06:25.482 --> 01:06:27.150
I was just trapped again.

01:06:27.233 --> 01:06:28.651
I was trapped.

01:06:28.735 --> 01:06:30.528
It felt like I was dying.

01:06:31.446 --> 01:06:33.698
The soul and memories are a pair.

01:06:33.781 --> 01:06:35.825
They shouldn't be separated.

01:06:36.618 --> 01:06:38.161
It feels like they are mine.

01:06:40.455 --> 01:06:42.040
How does that make sense?

01:06:45.043 --> 01:06:46.044
How?

01:06:47.003 --> 01:06:47.879
Seo-ri.

01:06:50.089 --> 01:06:51.466
My sweet girl.

01:06:52.800 --> 01:06:54.302
My sweet girl.

01:06:56.638 --> 01:06:58.097
My sweet girl.

01:06:58.806 --> 01:07:00.141
When are you coming?

01:07:00.725 --> 01:07:04.562
When is my sweet girl coming?

01:07:19.744 --> 01:07:21.162
Seo-ri.

01:07:21.788 --> 01:07:23.164
My sweet girl.

01:07:25.208 --> 01:07:26.501
Grandma!

01:07:26.584 --> 01:07:27.669
Grandma.

01:07:38.221 --> 01:07:41.849
Seo-ri, my sweet girl.

01:07:41.933 --> 01:07:43.101
Grandma!

01:07:44.269 --> 01:07:46.271
-Grandma, I'll be taller than you!
-Yeah.

01:07:46.354 --> 01:07:47.230
Okay, let's make sure!

01:07:47.313 --> 01:07:48.898
My sweet girl.

01:07:48.982 --> 01:07:50.692
This is crazy!

01:07:50.775 --> 01:07:51.693
Really?

01:07:51.776 --> 01:07:54.279
My sweet girl. How exciting!

01:07:55.947 --> 01:07:57.031
My sweet girl.

01:08:00.410 --> 01:08:02.161
My sweet girl.

01:08:10.920 --> 01:08:12.255
Grandma.

01:08:23.057 --> 01:08:24.350
That's not you.

01:08:26.227 --> 01:08:27.478
You're just a fake.

01:08:27.562 --> 01:08:29.355
Get out of my body.

01:08:31.524 --> 01:08:33.901
No, I am not a fake.

01:08:35.445 --> 01:08:36.404
I am…

01:08:37.322 --> 01:08:38.406
My name is…

01:08:44.704 --> 01:08:45.747
Shin Seo-ri.

01:09:20.573 --> 01:09:21.658
Just a little bit.

01:09:23.951 --> 01:09:25.244
Just wait a little bit longer.

01:09:50.561 --> 01:09:54.148
MY ROYAL NEMESIS

01:10:24.760 --> 01:10:26.055
I'm not letting you go anywhere.

01:10:26.139 --> 01:10:27.432
I am not going back.

01:10:27.515 --> 01:10:29.934
Because I have returned to where I belong.

01:10:30.017 --> 01:10:31.949
I'll put the brakes
on the resort development.

01:10:32.028 --> 01:10:34.313
I hear they're building an airport
next to the resort site.

01:10:34.397 --> 01:10:36.649
-What about Seo-jun?
-Your driver picked him up.

01:10:36.733 --> 01:10:38.651
Your threat was loud and clear.

01:10:38.735 --> 01:10:40.778
And you crossed a line you shouldn't have.

01:10:40.862 --> 01:10:43.322
Her condition has rapidly deteriorated.

01:10:44.449 --> 01:10:45.366
Grandma.

01:10:45.450 --> 01:10:47.118
Tell me.

01:10:47.201 --> 01:10:48.703
I will pay any price!

01:10:48.786 --> 01:10:52.165
Even at the cost
of never returning here again?

01:10:55.170 --> 01:10:57.170
Subtitle translation by Justin S. Kim
